Subject: [PATCH 024/230] Show how far the viewer moved on the board
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

scopeRankDelta compares consecutive observations of the same scope, so a
refetch can paint a real up/down chip instead of a rank that silently
changed. The chip carries an EN and FA screen-reader label
(board.rankUp / board.rankDown) and stays out of the first observation,
a scope switch or an unchanged rank.

